{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/2640e7325003abb98c62cb2df543b19a.avif?t=1772799582\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras_big/2640e7325003abb98c62cb2df543b19a.avif?t=1772799582 width=1560 height=558 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Roots Devour is a strategic exploration game centered around a card-connecting mechanism.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/c50b3b8e31c792a28044ef13771b14c3.webp?t=1772799582\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Deep within the silent forest, roots stir slowly into consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A primal ravenousness takes instant command of your mind.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Extend your roots\u2014pierce, entwine,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And devour the blood of those creatures thrashing in terror!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Connect, and connect again\u2014  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This frantic spread will not be halted.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Until the world is dismantled, reconstructed, and utterly swallowed by you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>All living things are nutrients; YOU are the only predator.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/e927f00c2f65cb68ab671561091e4a42.poster.avif?t=1772799582\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/e927f00c2f65cb68ab671561091e4a42.webm?t=1772799582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/e927f00c2f65cb68ab671561091e4a42.mp4?t=1772799582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/6e1f032191ebfe8d5b9a3a8d6184fef0.webp?t=1772799582\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cards are not tools,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But the fragments and extensions of your will;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Paths are not choices,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">but corridors the world is compelled to surrender.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At the cost of every irrevocable bond,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Emerging from the dim-lit woods, traversing swamp and snow, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Usurping even upon the realms of mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once the darkness is fully seized, you shall no longer require understanding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/715c899811425ab913e273e69bf656c1.poster.avif?t=1772799582\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/715c899811425ab913e273e69bf656c1.webm?t=1772799582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/715c899811425ab913e273e69bf656c1.mp4?t=1772799582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/04900afa4acb3c596deed858c42b2063.webp?t=1772799582\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cross paths with 'humans' burdened by their own secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As their superior, command their fates. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Interfere, manipulate, or bend them to your will. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your choices will pave the path of destiny, guiding the world to different fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">For you\u2026 is this slaughter,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">or an act of mercy? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/bac481830fcd8b47c9085e57f9b19970.poster.avif?t=1772799582\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/bac481830fcd8b47c9085e57f9b19970.webm?t=1772799582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/bac481830fcd8b47c9085e57f9b19970.mp4?t=1772799582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >**Game Features**</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a silent, eerie, Lovecraftian forest, embody an ancient god driven by an insatiable thirst for blood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a card-connecting mechanism. With hundreds of cards at your disposal, craft shifting combinations and discover endless playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore four distinct regions. Balance resource management, deck-building, puzzles, and card collection to overcome ever-evolving threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a diverse cast of humans. Choose to remain a silent observer or intervene in their lives. Build bonds with up to 7 key characters to unlock hidden stories and multiple endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/790614c92d3ae4d9b71eb0b62b5eb69d.poster.avif?t=1772799582\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/790614c92d3ae4d9b71eb0b62b5eb69d.webm?t=1772799582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Arrival","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2612690/ba93c083e7b0fcee480f27064cb12225379058f0.jpg"},{"name":"Act I: Ceremony","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2612690/bcc4dc28d9e6883cd3c05d56c6f4acc5294853af.jpg"},{"name":"Act II: Path of Redemption","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2612690/7262b95004f76e33f343f3cf8763b6520d6bd3d9.jpg"},{"name":"Act III: The Puppet\u2019s Will","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2612690/e11d2eaa0522c3c8e311b5420c1ffebb1cce014e.jpg"},{"name":"Act IV: The Guided","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2612690/b064d9578389092d559daceb90511157d38e082f.jpg"},{"name":"Act V: Endgame","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2612690/ccf360bfb12330bf8fcf426080d31d555db1b414.jpg"},{"name":"\"Owl\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2612690/589b0bf6f6cc53112ed7c941005fb62c9228790f.jpg"},{"name":"\"Ivy\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2612690/3196c7ea7cc6505f66811ad1cf62844c659ef1ef.jpg"},{"name":"\"Moth\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2612690/6ee2a4d309e7f91df5b2acfbd830138bdb5c8f0a.jpg"},{"name":"\"Crow\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2612690/9d28e288010f9e1c2334cd3ed5a10b5826794026.jpg"}],"total":29},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2612690?t=1772799582","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/1e433d87fc793aa68f4674f0f206fe5bfeb191fc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772799582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/218a86a7fd4916b2abb16bafb2c0be837894cd5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772799582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/218a86a7fd4916b2abb16bafb2c0be837894cd5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772799582","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN US!!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/27a5bee0f82ae6d1406fde499a5d85c5.avif?t=1772799582\" width=619 height=147 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord\uff1aClick the Discord link in the sidebar to join our community!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X\uff1a@RewindingStudio</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/2640e7325003abb98c62cb2df543b19a.avif?t=1772799582\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras_big/2640e7325003abb98c62cb2df543b19a.avif?t=1772799582 width=1560 height=558 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Roots Devour is a strategic exploration game centered around a card-connecting mechanism.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/c50b3b8e31c792a28044ef13771b14c3.webp?t=1772799582\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Deep within the silent forest, roots stir slowly into consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A primal ravenousness takes instant command of your mind.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Extend your roots\u2014pierce, entwine,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And devour the blood of those creatures thrashing in terror!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Connect, and connect again\u2014  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This frantic spread will not be halted.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Until the world is dismantled, reconstructed, and utterly swallowed by you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>All living things are nutrients; YOU are the only predator.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/e927f00c2f65cb68ab671561091e4a42.poster.avif?t=1772799582\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/e927f00c2f65cb68ab671561091e4a42.webm?t=1772799582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/e927f00c2f65cb68ab671561091e4a42.mp4?t=1772799582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/6e1f032191ebfe8d5b9a3a8d6184fef0.webp?t=1772799582\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cards are not tools,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But the fragments and extensions of your will;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Paths are not choices,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">but corridors the world is compelled to surrender.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At the cost of every irrevocable bond,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Emerging from the dim-lit woods, traversing swamp and snow, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Usurping even upon the realms of mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once the darkness is fully seized, you shall no longer require understanding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/715c899811425ab913e273e69bf656c1.poster.avif?t=1772799582\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/715c899811425ab913e273e69bf656c1.webm?t=1772799582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/715c899811425ab913e273e69bf656c1.mp4?t=1772799582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/04900afa4acb3c596deed858c42b2063.webp?t=1772799582\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cross paths with 'humans' burdened by their own secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As their superior, command their fates. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Interfere, manipulate, or bend them to your will. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your choices will pave the path of destiny, guiding the world to different fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">For you\u2026 is this slaughter,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">or an act of mercy? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/bac481830fcd8b47c9085e57f9b19970.poster.avif?t=1772799582\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/bac481830fcd8b47c9085e57f9b19970.webm?t=1772799582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/bac481830fcd8b47c9085e57f9b19970.mp4?t=1772799582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >**Game Features**</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a silent, eerie, Lovecraftian forest, embody an ancient god driven by an insatiable thirst for blood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a card-connecting mechanism. With hundreds of cards at your disposal, craft shifting combinations and discover endless playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore four distinct regions. Balance resource management, deck-building, puzzles, and card collection to overcome ever-evolving threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a diverse cast of humans. Choose to remain a silent observer or intervene in their lives. Build bonds with up to 7 key characters to unlock hidden stories and multiple endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/790614c92d3ae4d9b71eb0b62b5eb69d.poster.avif?t=1772799582\" width=1138 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/extras/790614c92d3ae4d9b71eb0b62b5eb69d.webm?t=1772799582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Rewinding Games"],"dlc":[4179950],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612690/14e11954840a20f4ff48edf84771a75257ed428c/header.jpg?t=1772799582","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92023 Developed by Rewinding Games. Published by GCORES PUBLISHING. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2612690/436510298/22e9b6503c9fc0f1d42028e4ed42c54013d872d5/1767761735/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767763045","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/26